<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-RESULTS OF SYDNEY INTERNATIONAL TENNIS TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS OF SYDNEY INTERNATIONAL TENNIS TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the Sydney International tennis tournament on Saturday:</p>
<p>Men's singles final:</p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) beat Carlos Moya (Spain) 6-3 6-1  </p>
<p>Women's singles final (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) 6-1 5-7 6-1</p>
</text>
